<title>UK: Edge sells development to Save &amp; Prosper.</title>
<headline>Edge sells development to Save &amp; Prosper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retail warehouse property group Edge Properties Plc said on Wednesday that it is selling a retail warehouse development in Cardiff, Wales to Save &amp; Prosper for 6.8 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the scheme has been developed through its 51 percent owned subsidiary Edge Developments Cardiff Limited. The minority interest in EDCL is owned by Culver Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Edge expects the sale to complete following the anticipated completion of the development in April.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
